      "subject": "chore(builder): React type definitions installed and vite-env typed (MS-2026-0006)",
      "body": "The Builder had never been typechecked: vite build does not check types, and a syntax error in a dead file made tsc skip type checking entirely until F-33 removed it. With it gone, tsc reported 384 errors. Most come from missing React type definitions (@types/react and @types/react-dom for React 18.3, now installed as dev dependencies); 10 came from vite-env.d.ts sitting outside the checked files, now included, which clears every asset-import error. The remaining errors are fixed area by area in this mission, and the build will then enforce the typecheck.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
